'''Swirly Blade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Old Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 100,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is constructed out of sprinkle-covered gingerbread with three large peppermints placed along the center. Encasing the blade is a white frosting edge, leading into the gingerbread house guard. Connected to the bottom of the gingerbread house by frosting is the diamond-cut gingerbread handle with a pommel made out of sugary frosting.

==Trivia==
*It is a victim of mass duping causing it to lose a lot of value
*It is part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Swirly_Set Full Swirly Set] with [[Swirly Axe]] and [[Swirly Gun]].
*This is the 3rd weapon obtainable through the gifting center in a Christmas event after [[Jinglegun]] and [[Lugercane]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*This, [[Ornament]], [[Chroma Ornament]], [[Bauble]], [[Chroma Bauble]], [[Evergun]] and [[Chroma Evergun]] are currently the only knives and guns obtainable through gifting.

